# YouTube Agent & Channel Manager (Muxriddin AI)

YouTube Data API v3 integratsiyasi va AI Agent yordamida:
1. **Videolarni avtomatik yuklash (Upload)** — Katta hajmdagi videolarni ishonchli (resumable) yuklash.
2. **Rejalashtirish (Scheduling)** — Videoni ma'lum bir sana va soatda avtomatik e'lon qilish (`publishAt`).
3. **Kanal va videolar statistikasi (Analytics)** — Obunachilar soni, ko'rishlar, layklar va izohlarni real vaqtda kuzatish.
4. **AI Kontent Yaratuvchi (AI Agent)** — Yuqori CTR beruvchi sarlavhalar, SEO tavsif, teglar, thumbnail g'oyalari va YouTube Shorts ssenariylari.

---

## 1. Tezkor ishga tushirish (CLI)

Terminal orqali (PowerShell):

```powershell
# Yordam oynasi
.\backend\.venv\Scripts\python.exe youtube_agent.py --help

# 1. Google OAuth orqali YouTube hisobingizni ulash
.\backend\.venv\Scripts\python.exe youtube_agent.py auth

# 2. Kanal statistikasini ko'rish
.\backend\.venv\Scripts\python.exe youtube_agent.py channel

# 3. So'nggi videolarning ko'rishlar va layklar statistikasini ko'rish
.\backend\.venv\Scripts\python.exe youtube_agent.py videos

# 4. Videoni yuklash va rejalashtirish
.\backend\.venv\Scripts\python.exe youtube_agent.py upload "video.mp4" `
    --title "Sun'iy intellekt kelajagi" `
    --description "Ushbu videoda sun'iy intellekt haqida batafsil gaplashamiz..." `
    --tags "ai,texnologiya,kelajak" `
    --schedule "2026-10-25 18:00"

# 5. AI yordamida YouTube SEO metadata (sarlavha, tavsif, teglar, thumbnail) yaratish
.\backend\.venv\Scripts\python.exe youtube_agent.py ai-meta "Sun'iy intellekt orqali pul ishlash"

# 6. AI yordamida 45 soniyalik viral YouTube Shorts ssenariysini yaratish
.\backend\.venv\Scripts\python.exe youtube_agent.py ai-shorts "Dasturchilar bilishi shart bo'lgan 3 ta sir" --seconds 45

# 7. 🔥 TO'LIQ AVTOMATIK VIDEO (.MP4) YARATISH (AI Ssenariy + Ovoz/TTS + Vizual montaj)
.\backend\.venv\Scripts\python.exe youtube_agent.py generate-video "Sun'iy intellekt kelajagi"

# 8. To'liq video yaratish VA uni darhol YouTube'ga rejalashtirib yuklash:
.\backend\.venv\Scripts\python.exe youtube_agent.py generate-video "Dasturlash sirlari" `
    --upload `
    --schedule "2026-10-25 18:00"
```

