## 3. Sozlamalar (`.env`)

Google Cloud Console (console.cloud.google.com) da YouTube Data API v3 yoqilgan loyihadan OAuth 2.0 ma'lumotlarini oling va `.env` ga kiriting:

```env
YOUTUBE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
YOUTUBE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret
YOUTUBE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8000/api/v1/youtube/oauth/callback
```
